  "thesis": "A ratcheted volatility-scaled daily band may remain in BTC trends through ordinary noise yet switch to cash after volatility-adjusted breakdowns, preserving enough upside while avoiding sufficiently deep adverse paths to improve fee-adjusted risk-adjusted performance over full-capital buy-and-hold.",
  "economic_rationale": "The mechanism changes its trend threshold with current causal volatility and path-dependent band state instead of relying on a fixed price channel or endpoint return. It is useful only if multiplier 3 retains material after-cost upside, lowers drawdown, improves Calmar, survives annual breadth and remains stable at two frozen multiplier neighbors. Reduced exposure alone cannot pass.",
